   "date": "2026-10-06T13:59:24-05:00",
   "body": "Pretty straightforward quest. The warriors are a bit deeper into the area, so you want to fight your way in and not just stay outside targeting myrmidons and sorceresses.\r\n\r\n\r\nMake sure to pick [quest=951] from Onu to combine with this quest. These relics are found all over the ruins, some looking like chalices and some like fallen vases. [u]Note, that currently in Forever,[item=5332] only spawns a level 1 cat with 42 Health[/u]  making it essentially useless, so feel free to skip all the [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/object=13359/cat-figurine#map]Cat Figurines[/url] you come across.\r\n\r\nYou'll also loot plenty of [item=279276] while doing this. Combine [b]20[/b] of them and head out to [b]59, 22[/b] to use the amulet by the [b]Fathom Stone[/b] to unlock another [url=https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=98028/baron-marinous]new quest[/url]. This spawns an elite who drops [item=279275], and everyone in the group is eligible to loot it, so don't hesitate to invite nearby players for this one.",
